        "text": "KREA 2 IDENTITY EDIT  -  v1.2 (Fidelity update)\nUse an image like a LoRA: your character/scene goes in as a reference, plain-English\ninstructions do the rest.\n\nQUICK START:  1) load your image in group 1   2) write the instruction in group 3   3) Queue.\nThe Fidelity dial (group 4) ships at 4 = strong likeness. Two-image person-into-scene: enable\ngroup 2 (right-click its title -> toggle Bypass).\n\nRequires the comfyui-krea2edit nodes from this release or newer.\ngithub.com/lbouaraba/comfyui-krea2edit   -   huggingface.co/conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit"
