      "widgets_values": [
        "OUTPAINT + IDENTITY EDIT\n\nPass 1 (blue group, below): AnyPaint extends the canvas. Set padding on\nKrea2 AnyPaint Prepare (left / top / right / bottom; preset: top 384 for\nan out-of-frame head). Its prompt should describe the WHOLE image.\n\nPass 2 (top): identity edit takes the pass 1 result as image 1 (scene)\nand the face photo in group 2 as image 2 (person). Output size follows\nthe outpainted canvas.\n\nBoth passes are saved: krea2_outpaint_pass1_* and krea2_outpaint_identity_*.\n\nThings to try if the face doesn't take:\n- Krea2EditModelPatch: set the person position to 'beside' instead of aligned\n- ref_boost 4 -> 6; or connect a face-region MASK to ref_boost_mask\n- lower grounding_px if compositions come out doubled"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
